<title>USA: Union Pacific Corp sets $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Corp sets $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Union Pacific Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNION PACIFIC CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.927  FIRST PAY DATE 06/01/1997</p>
